        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi chitukweti mudimu iwu, mwonamutunatambuli luwi hitwazeyaloŋaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tunaleki yuma yansonyi yakujinda. Hitwendaŋa nakudi-mbanaku; hitwaheŋeshaŋa mazu aNzambi nakutwambaku. Ilaŋa chitwashimunaŋa nsaŋu yaNzambi yalala chalumbuluka, twadimwekeshaŋa kuyinleji yanyichima yawantu ejima, niNzambi namoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi nsaŋu yetu yayiwahi yinabutewi, yinabutewi mudi antu adi nakujilumuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mudi wena nzambi yampata yamakonu naputishi mesu ayitoŋojoka yawantu abula kwitiya; kuchina mwaana wansaŋu yayiwahi yalubanji lwakulema kwaKristu, chinfwana chaNzambi, kuyichiila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa hitwadishimunaŋa etu awenuku, twashimunaŋa Kristu Yesu netu diyi Mwanta. Etu kwetu tuyanduŋu jenu hansaŋu yaKristu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa Nzambi welili nindi, Chejeji chimwekani hadiŋi mwidima; diyi natoŋeki munyichima yetu, nakwinkelamu chejeji chakwiluka nachu lubanji lwakulema kwaNzambi, lwamwekanaŋa kumesu aKristu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ihetidi tudi nadu munsaba jamawumba, kulonda Ŋovu jabadika nankashi jiikali jambala jaNzambi, jibuli kwikala jetwetu aweni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atukabishaŋa mbadi jejima, kutukaŋesha nehi; twenda tujinoka, kutukuma nehi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "enda atuhaŋa, kutushiya kanka wetu nehi; anatubuli dehi hamaseki, etu kunoŋa nehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Twasendaŋa munyijimba kufwa kwafwiliyi Yesu kutwayaloŋa kwejima, mafuku ejima; kulonda wumi waYesu wumwekanaŋa nawa munyijimba yetu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa etu twahandaŋa atuhanaŋa mafuku ejima tufwi hansaŋu yaYesu, kulonda wumi waYesu wumwekani munyijimba yetu yanoŋaŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi kufwa kwakoŋaŋa mudetu, ilaŋa wumi wakoŋaŋa mudenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Twahoshaŋa nanichi chitwetiyaloŋa, muloŋa tukweti spiritu yakukuhwelela yowumu, mwomwasonekeluwu nawu, Nahoshi nanichi chinetiyili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa tweluka netu iwu wasaŋwili Mwanta Yesu mudi afu, wakatusaŋula ninetu chimu naYesu, wakatwimika kumesu indi chimu nanenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuma yejimiyi tunayimweni hansaŋu yenwenu, kulonda luwi chilukuvulila antu amavulu, lwakavulishi kusakilila nankashi nawa, kulonda Nzambi alemi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dihu hafuma kubula kuzeya; muloŋa hela muntu wetu wahanzi wudi nakuya nakunoŋa, muntu wetu wamukachi wudi nakuya nakubalumuka wamwiha hefuku hefuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa lukadi lwetu lwakatataka lwapepela, lwatukoŋelaŋa pezu yakulema kwabadika nankashi, kulema kwahaya nyaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hitwatalaŋa yuma yamonewaŋaku, twatalaŋa yuma yinabuli kumonawu; yuma yamonewaŋa yakatataka, hakwila yuma yabulaŋa kumonawu yahaya nyaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
